  "problem": "From top to bottom, what are the missing expressions in the following polynomial division problem?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{} \\\\  & x+3\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}-4x+\\phantom{1}0\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{{x}^{3}+3{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,3{x}^{2}-4x+0 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,3{x}^{2}-9x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\boxed{} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{5x+15}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-\\,15\\end{aligned}\n$$",
